onboardingNudge.text:
Hi {name}, your logbook is still empty

{opening}

RECOMMENDED FOR XCTRACK AND AIR³
Set it up once, never upload again

FolderSync watches XCTrack's tracklog folder and hands every new flight to We-Fly as soon as you're back on Wi-Fi. Your whole archive comes along too, and duplicates are skipped.

1. Create a device password
   In We-Fly, open Profile > Connected services and tap Generate on the Instrument & cloud sync card. On a laptop? Scan it onto your phone with the QR code.
2. Add We-Fly to FolderSync
   Install FolderSync from the Play Store and add a WebDAV account:
     Server URL: {webdavUrl}
     Username:   {email}
     Password:   your device password from step 1
3. Pair it with your Tracklogs folder
   Upload only, from {tracklogs}. Android 11 or later hides that folder; this two-minute guide unlocks it: {folderGuideUrl}

Set up auto-sync: {syncGuideUrl}

NOT ON XCTRACK?
{otherWays}

What one file gives you: every IGC file becomes a map and altitude profile, your thermals, wind and glides, personal records, and the first of your badges.

